# Wretched Doll {1}{B}, 3/1: "{B}, {T}: Surveil 1." It is a creature, so on turn 1 it is summoning sick and the ability is
# refused (CR 302.6). On turn 3 Bot1 spends Mox Jet's {B} (and an Island) on a second Doll, leaving only Mox Ruby's {R}: the
# first Doll's ability is refused for want of {B}. On turn 5 Mox Jet alone pays it, exactly: the pool is empty, and the
# surveil keeps Lightning Bolt on top. The Doll is tapped, so it is refused again that turn. On turn 7 it untaps and surveils
# again, now binning the top card, Counterspell.

